OL,3,ALindsay Clancy murder trial collapses
OL,4,Aas jury fails to reach unanimous
OL,5,Averdict
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge in the trial of Lindsay
OL,8,FClancy - the US mother accused of
OL,9,Fmurdering her three children - says he
OL,10,Fwill declare a mistrial, prompting an
OL,11,Faudible gasp in the courtroom
OL,13,FIt comes after a note from the jury
OL,14,Fsaid "it is with a heavy heart that we
OL,15,Freport we were unable to come to a
OL,16,Funanimous decision"
OL,18,FThe prosecution agrees it should go to
OL,19,Fa mistrial, but Lindsay Clancy's legal
OL,20,Fteam want to appeal the decision - the
OL,21,Fjudge says they have one hour
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
