OL,3,ALindsay Clancy murder trial collapses
OL,4,Aas jury fails to reach unanimous
OL,5,Averdict
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou can watch live coverage above
OL,9,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,10,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,11,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora, 5,
OL,12,FDawson, 3, and eight-month-old Callan -
OL,13,Fat their Massachusetts home in 2023
OL,15,FShe does not deny killing them, but her
OL,16,Flawyer argues she was suffering from
OL,17,Fpostpartum psychosis, and could not
OL,18,Fdistinguish right from wrong
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
